---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const metadata = { title: '聯絡我們' };
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4 tracking-wide">聯絡我們</h1>
      <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-gold-300 mx-auto mb-6"></div>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        感謝您對台灣神明文化的關注！無論是建議、合作或詢問，我們都非常樂意聽取您的聲音。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">聯絡信箱</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">如有任何問題或建議，歡迎透過電子郵件與我們聯繫，我們會在收到信件後盡快回覆。</p>
        <a href="mailto:taiwanese.gods@gmail.com" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 hover:underline font-medium text-lg">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
          taiwanese.gods@gmail.com
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">回覆時間</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">我們通常會在 1-3 個工作天內回覆您的來信。若為緊急事項，請在信件主旨中標註。</p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm italic">來信時請簡述您的需求，以便我們更有效率地為您服務。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-6">常見聯絡類型</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white/60 dark:bg-gray-800/60 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">💡</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-2">內容建議</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">發現資訊錯誤、內容不完整，或有新的神明/廟宇想推薦收錄，歡迎告訴我們。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/60 dark:bg-gray-800/60 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🤝</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-2">合作提案</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">廟宇單位、文化機構、旅遊業者或教育單位如有合作意願，歡迎來信洽談。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/60 dark:bg-gray-800/60 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">📝</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 mb-2">內容授權</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">若需引用或轉載本站內容（文字、圖片），請先來信說明用途與方式，以利授權評估。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a href="/" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-lg transition-colors font-medium">
        回首頁
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
